      "id": "plan",
      "claim": "Up to $640 of unused FSA money carries over; anything above it not claimed is forfeited at the end of the plan year, December 31; claims are made in Kestrel Hub",
      "source": "Kestrel flexible spending account plan document, 2027 (fictional)"
    }
  ],
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "stakes",
      "block": "canvas",
      "vo": "You have three thousand two hundred dollars in your flexible spending account. On December thirty-first, only six hundred forty carries over. The rest is gone.",
      "props": {
        "sketch": "expire",
        "sketchParams": {
          "total": 5,
          "keep": 1,
          "each": 640,
          "prefix": "$"
        },
        "sketchText": {
          "KEEP": "carries into next year",
          "LOSE": "is gone",
          "YEAREND": "Dec 31"
        },
        "sketchSay": {
          "FILL": "thousand",
          "YEAREND": "December",
          "KEEP": "carries"
        },
        "source": "Kestrel flexible spending account plan document, 2027 (fictional)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "plan",
      "block": "canvas",
      "vo": "It is all in your plan document. Up to six hundred forty dollars carries over. Anything above that you have not claimed is forfeited at the end of the plan year.",
      "props": {
        "source": "Kestrel flexible spending account plan document, 2027 (fictional)",
        "elements": [
          {
            "type": "document",
            "x": 90,
            "y": 230,
            "w": 900,
            "h": 1160,
            "kicker": "Kestrel benefits",
            "title": "Flexible spending account",
            "size": 34,
            "at": 0,
            "enter": "none",
            "sections": [
              {
                "heading": "What it covers",
                "text": "Medical, dental and vision costs your health plan does not pay: copays, glasses, prescriptions and more."
              },
              {
                "heading": "How to claim",
                "text": "Upload the receipt in Kestrel Hub within 90 days of the expense. Most claims are paid in five working days."
              },
              {
                "heading": "Who can use it",
                "text": "Any employee who enrolls during open enrollment, within 30 days of starting, or after a qualifying life event such as a birth or a move."
              },
              {
                "heading": "Carryover",
                "text": "Up to 640 dollars of unused money carries over into next year."
              },
              {
                "heading": "The deadline",
                "text": "Anything above the carryover that you have not claimed is forfeited at the end of the plan year, on December 31."
              }
            ],
            "scroll": [
              {
                "to": "Carryover",
                "say": "Up"
              },
              {
                "to": "The deadline",
                "say": "Anything"
              }
            ],
            "marks": [
              {
                "words": "640 dollars",
                "style": "circle",
                "say": "forty"
              },
              {
                "words": "forfeited at the end of the plan year",
                "style": "highlight",
                "say": "forfeited"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
